    "pocketstation::connector::status::ConnectorDeliveryReadiness::Ready: Identifies the ready state or stage represented by `ConnectorDeliveryReadiness`.",
    "accepts_delivery: Reports whether accepts delivery is true for `ConnectorDeliveryReadiness`.",
    "pocketstation::connector::status::ConnectorHealth: Reports the current operational health of a connector worker.",
