    "pocketstation::connector::status::ConnectorHealth::Degraded: Represents the degraded alternative defined by `ConnectorHealth`.",
    "pocketstation::connector::status::ConnectorRecovery: Declares the recovery state exposed after a connector failure.",
    "pocketstation::connector::status::ConnectorRecovery::Idle: Represents the idle alternative defined by `ConnectorRecovery`.",
    "pocketstation::connector::status::ConnectorRecovery::Reconnecting: Represents the reconnecting alternative defined by `ConnectorRecovery`.",
    "pocketstation::connector::status::ConnectorServiceStatus: Reports the structured connector service status.",
    "delivery_readiness: Returns the delivery readiness associated with `ConnectorServiceStatus`.",
    "health: Returns the health held by `ConnectorServiceStatus`.",
    "recovery: Returns the recovery held by `ConnectorServiceStatus`.",
    "readiness_reason_code: Returns the readiness reason code held by `ConnectorServiceStatus`.",
