    "revision: Returns the revision held by `ConnectorServiceStatus`.",
    "last_transition_elapsed_ns: Returns the last transition elapsed nanoseconds held by `ConnectorServiceStatus`.",
    "accepts_delivery: Reports whether accepts delivery is true for `ConnectorServiceStatus`."
